CS612 Bomb Lab

You have 6 phases with which to blow yourself up. Have a nice day!

Files:
  bomb          The executable binary bomb.
  bomb.c        Source for the bomb's main routine. We are not giving you
                the source for phase_1 through phase_6 -- that's the part
                you have to reverse-engineer from the disassembly.
  cs612bomb.md  The lab instructions. Read this first.

Run it with:
  ./bomb                              (reads phase input from stdin, one line per phase)
  ./bomb <rollnumber>_answers.txt     (reads from the file until EOF, then switches to stdin)

Submission requires TWO files, both prefixed with your roll number,
e.g. 21110123_answers.txt and 21110123_report.md -- the answers file,
and a short report describing how you solved (or attempted) each
phase. See cs612bomb.md sections 6-7 for details.

Good luck, and welcome to the bomb squad!
